{"product_id":"the-berenstain-bears-by-the-sea","title":"The Berenstain Bears by the Sea","description":"\u003cp\u003eNow young children can read Bear Country tales all by themselves! In the Berenstain Bears' exciting Step into Reading debut, Brother and Sister can't wait to go swimming. But first, there are many jobs to do in the Bear Family's summer house. There are rooms to clean, groceries to put away, closets to air out, suitcases to unpack, and on and on. Will the cubs ever get to dip their tootsies in the sea?\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 154 x 230\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Stan Berenstain | Jan Berenstain\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780679887195\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 32\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45738317185177,"sku":"15RE-59780679887195","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ca651ff2dd1_The_Berenstain_Bears_by_the_Sea_Stan_Berenstain___Jan_Berenstain.jpg?v=1758563906","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/the-berenstain-bears-by-the-sea","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}